{"label":"Public USITC original PDF cells; synthetic source identities are supplied by tests, not government approval.","year":2003,"pages":[{"page":5,"cells":[{"text":"Harmonized Tariff Schedule of the United States (2003) \u2013 Supplement 1","x":124.56,"y":753.36},{"text":"Annotated for Statistical Reporting Purposes","x":241.92000000000002,"y":744},{"text":"XVIII","x":556.8,"y":705.36},{"text":"91-5","x":557.28,"y":696},{"text":"Statistical Notes","x":48.95999999999998,"y":677.28},{"text":"1.","x":48.96,"y":658.56},{"text":"The calculation of duties on various watches, clocks, watch movements and clock movements requires that these articles be","x":64.8,"y":658.56},{"text":"constructively separated into their component parts and each component separately valued. The individual components shall be","x":64.8,"y":649.1999999999999},{"text":"separately reported under the statistical suffixes show below. In each instance the sum of the values of the individual components shall","x":64.8,"y":639.8399999999999},{"text":"be equal to the total value of the article. In those instances where the components of an article are to be separately reported under the","x":64.8,"y":630.4799999999999},{"text":"following reporting scheme, the entry should include all the individually named components even if not included in the shipment. In such","x":64.8,"y":621.1199999999999},{"text":"instance the entered quantity and value would be zero. For example, entry of a battery powered watch, imported without a battery,","x":64.8,"y":611.7599999999999},{"text":"classifiable under subheading 9101.11.40 would include a line for the statistical reporting number for the battery (9101.11.4040) with","x":64.8,"y":602.3999999999999},{"text":"the quantity and value shown as zero. To determine the proper statistical reporting number(s) for the subheadings enumerated below,","x":64.8,"y":593.0399999999998},{"text":"the importer shall combine the applicable 8-digit subheading number with the applicab